source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A Windows path written with a pair is a forced newline, so Jira breaks after the drive letter and jiro reads a hard break.
-- input.jira --
C:\\dir
-- rendered.html --
<p>C:<br class="atl-forced-newline" />dir</p>
-- want.md --
C:\
dir
-- warnings.json --
[]
